cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the CFR paper and the version of the software used."
type: software
title: "CounterFactual Retrieval (CFR)"
version: "0.3.0"
abstract: >-
  Code for CounterFactual Retrieval for Evidence-Aware Individual Animal
  Identification, including foreground-mask generation, retrieval evaluation,
  and experiment configurations. The cfr-sam3-masks package provides the
  updated mask extractor; evaluation workflows are provided as scripts.
